{"availability":"available","full":"wonderful-team/evoloop","name":"evoloop","description":"EvoLoop — Cross-platform autonomous AI agent: control computers & Android devices from a single interface, learn from demonstrations, and collaborate across agents. Desktop / web / server / embedded.","category":"Education","language":"Python","stars":0,"forks":0,"created":"2024-12-31T03:05:28Z","updated":"2026-09-29T02:45:24Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://evoloop.cn","topics":["a2a-protocol","agent-to-agent","ai-agents","android-automation","computer-control","long-horizon-agents","multi-agent","skills"],"demo":"https://www.evoloop.cn/agent","color":"#25392f","ink":"#d1e5c5","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-04T08:16:53.532Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-04T08:16:53.532Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-04T08:16:53.532Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-03T22:13:06.351Z","stars":0,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-04T08:16:53.532Z","stars":0,"forks":0}],"technologies":["Python"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["EvoLoop 是一个自值守智能体，任务可编排，在智能体内部设立三权沟通机制：决策者、执行者、评审监察者，让任务的每一项落实到位。","你在使用 Agent 时是否遇到过：规划一个长程任务，方案看起来很好，且有 SKILL 约束，实际执行不完整、留尾巴，甚至跑偏——你只能反复检查、多轮沟通去纠正？","EvoLoop 致力于解决此类问题，为此新设计了值守式任务系统：任务到点自动执行、每步进度实时留底；完成后由评审监察者站在你的立场核实——执行者说「做完了」不算数，不完整就打回重做；资金和不可逆操作由决策者（你）拍板。你只管规划任务、验收结果。"],"features":[],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/wonderful-team/evoloop/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"32a6ec2c1bd506527f82b23876d500ba542a987086a2a14c173a99be0eeb5cfc","extractedAt":"2026-10-03T22:13:06.476Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-03T22:13:06.476Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"EvoLoop 是一个自值守智能体，任务可编排，在智能体内部设立三权沟通机制：决策者、执行者、评审监察者，让任务的每一项落实到位。","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/wonderful-team/evoloop/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[],"fingerprint":"32a6ec2c1bd506527f82b23876d500ba542a987086a2a14c173a99be0eeb5cfc","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/wonderful-team/evoloop/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-03T22:13:06.476Z"},"overvi